* SPICE netlist for the schematic

VX 4 2 DC 0           ; Voltage source VX connected between node 4 and node 2

RX 4 2 1k             ; Resistor RX connected between node 4 and node 2
R2 2 3 1k             ; Resistor R2 connected between node 2 and node 3
R1 2 0 1k             ; Resistor R1 connected between node 2 and ground (0)

CX 2 0 1u             ; Capacitor CX connected between node 2 and ground (0)

* Voltage Output node
VO 3 0                ; Output voltage at node 3

* End of netlist